  "title": "Chapter 8: Matter and Its Properties",
  "order": 57,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4tnq4v8",
      "content": "Matter is anything that occupies space and has mass. Everything around us such as air, water, plants, animals and objects is made of matter. The study of matter and its properties is an important part of physics and chemistry."
    },
