      "level": 2,
      "content": "Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "05to64i",
      "content": "• Matter has mass and occupies space."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "w1crlch",
      "content": "• Density = Mass / Volume."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "h9s0sft",
      "content": "• SI unit of pressure is Pascal."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "45ian6j",
      "content": "• There are three main states of matter: solid, liquid and gas."
    }
